    "background_story": "Pookie was a curious and adventurous cat who loved to explore the night sky. One evening, while gazing out the window, she became fascinated with the distant, icy world of Pluto. Entranced by its mysterious and rugged beauty, Pookie began to identify with the underdog planet. Like Pluto, she felt like an outsider, often getting into mischief and mayhem in the household. But as she delved deeper into the world of astronomy, Pookie discovered that Pluto's unique orbit and composition made it a fascinating and valuable part of the solar system. Inspired by Pluto's resilience and individuality, Pookie adopted the dwarf planet as her spirit guide, embracing her own quirks and celebrating her differences.",
